      "url": "https://www.thegazette.co.uk/Belfast/issue/1889/page/243",
      "note": "S.R.&O. 1957 No. 189 (County Borough of Belfast) and No. 188 (County Down): Orders in Council under section 11 of the Boundary Survey (Ireland) Act 1854, made 29 Aug 1957, in force 1 Mar 1958, extending Belfast at Sydenham into Belfast Lough."
    },
    {
      "label": "Belfast Gazette, issue 1965, 20 February 1959, p. 66",
